🔔 EventEmitter – What Concept Are You Learning From This?

This code teaches you the Event-Driven Programming model in JavaScript.

In simple words:

Some code listens for events, and some code emits events.
When an event happens, all listeners are notified.

This is the Observer Pattern.

🧠 Big Picture Intuition (Simple Words)

Think of YouTube notifications 📢

You subscribe to a channel

When the channel uploads a video, YouTube notifies all subscribers

If you unsubscribe, you stop getting notifications

That’s exactly what this EventEmitter does.

